# Code-coverage artefacts (Q.y, babelstone-2t16.13) — emitted by CI and local runs,
# never committed: the .NET coverage/ tree + merged cobertura, the Go statement
# profile, and the Python coverage.py data + cobertura XML.
# CI writes the .NET tree to the repo-root coverage/ (--results-directory
# coverage/unit, coverage/integration; merged coverage/merged.cobertura.xml);
# the per-project /engine/coverage/ rule remains for runs scoped there.
/coverage/
/engine/coverage/
coverage.out
.coverage
mcp-server/coverage.xml

